{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000001", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "- `std_*`：标准层，保留接纳记录、源行号、质量状态和源ID。\n- `dim_*`：统一实体维度。\n- `map_*`：源系统ID到统一ID的显式映射。\n- `bridge_*`：线路、方向、站点和站序关系，并保存关系粒度的空间属性。\n- `fact_*`：默认分析视图，只暴露通过治理规则的记录。\n- `mart_*`：常用预聚合指标。\n- `ops_*`、`quality_*`、`meta_*`：采集、质量、血缘和口径审计。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["数据治理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0002", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0002", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 12}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000002", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "公交、轨交标准层统一使用WGS84经纬度：\n\n- `normalized_crs='EPSG:4326'` 是标准空间字段的唯一目标标签。\n- 高德原始点线按采集字段接纳为 `GCJ-02`，使用迭代逆转换生成WGS84；原始值继续保存在源治理库或 `source_*` 字段。\n- 官方公交站源点为 EPSG:32651，使用 `pyproj` 转为 EPSG:4326。\n- 转换不改变源ID、统一ID或客流事实ID。\n- 没有可靠源CRS的对象继续标记 `UNKNOWN`，不因数值看似经纬度而擅自转为WGS84。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["人群管控", "公交站点", "地面公交", "数据治理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0003", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0003", "line_start": 13, "line_end": 22}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000003", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "- 高德公交和轨交站序坐标来自相应方向线路的同一次采集，应落在同源线路几何上。\n- `distance_to_route_m <= 25` 标记为 `OK`；25–100米为 `REVIEW`；大于100米为 `OUTLIER`。\n- 统一线路的线路上下文站点使用 `bridge_metro_line_station`，而不是强迫换乘站所有线路共用一个平台点。\n- 物理站点 `dim_metro_station` 可汇总多个高德站点ID。线路地图必须使用关系表中的线路上下文点。\n- 公交同一 `stop_id` 的多条线路观测不会被丢弃；主站点点位不能替代路线停靠点。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "必须", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["地面公交"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0004", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0004", "line_start": 23, "line_end": 30}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000004", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "- 既有20条统一 `line_id` 保持稳定。\n- 高德46条方向/支线路径使用 `route_direction_id`，再映射到统一线路。\n- 既有物理 `station_id` 保持稳定；高德新增站使用后续ID。\n- 高德站点优先按稳定源ID映射；源ID无法匹配时才允许唯一精确站名匹配；仍未匹配的高德站点作为新实体接纳。\n- 同名不同物理站不得仅凭名称合并。线路上下文和高德站点ID是判定依据。\n- 客流源的站点ID仍结合线路上下文映射；默认事实表不暴露源站点ID。", "knowledge_type": "prohibition", "normative_force": "prohibited", "source_modality": "不得", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["人群管控"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0005", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0005", "line_start": 31, "line_end": 39}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000005", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "`catalog.meta_source_dataset` 登记源路径、粒度、行数和目标对象；`catalog.meta_id_mapping` 登记源ID映射；`catalog.meta_quality_result` 保存构建结果。\n\n包含原始订单号的治理库不随Skill分发。重建时通过 `SHANGHAI_TRAFFIC_SOURCE_DB` 指向受控治理库；若需从原始文件重建治理库，通过 `SHANGHAI_TRAFFIC_PROJECT_ROOT` 指向受控源项目。查询已打包资产不需要这些源文件。\n\n公交/轨交必须检查：\n\n- 高德站点ID映射完整性。\n- 标准空间对象EPSG:4326完整性。\n- 公交方向线路点线距离。\n- 轨交方向线路点线距离。\n- 统一轨交线站点线距离。\n- 客流事实维度映射不回退。\n\n当前仍允许并明确报告的警告包括：日期级活动缺少具体时刻、部分网约车源CRS未知、少量场馆订单坐标无效，以及没有高德点位的遗留轨交站。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "必须", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["人群管控", "出租车与网约车", "地面公交", "数据治理", "活动场馆"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0006", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0006", "line_start": 40, "line_end": 56}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE-000006", "doc_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE", "statement": "- 原始订单号不进入资产包，仅保存不可逆SHA-256 `order_hash`。\n- 订单级精确时间和坐标属于敏感数据；对外输出优先使用15分钟聚合。\n- 公交交易数、轨交人次和网约车订单量纲不同，只能并列比较，不能直接求和。\n- `rainfall_1h_mm` 是滚动一小时累计量，不得对10分钟记录求和。\n- 活动表只有用户提供的日期，不得根据交通峰值反推演出时刻。", "knowledge_type": "prohibition", "normative_force": "prohibited", "source_modality": "不得", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["出租车与网约车", "地面公交", "数据治理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@sec-0007", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "PROJECT-DATA-GOVERNANCE@src-0007", "line_start": 57, "line_end": 63}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
